  "query": "-- The doctor's Object Lock scan (OL31): every multipart lock intent, in the\n-- table's own key order, so the model's decoder can report the corrupt ones.\nSELECT\n    l.bucket,\n    l.upload_id,\n    l.mode,\n    l.retain_until,\n    l.legal_hold\nFROM upload_object_lock AS l\nORDER BY\n    l.bucket COLLATE \"C\",\n    l.upload_id COLLATE \"C\"\n",
